<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; color: #1a1a2e; background: #f8f9fa; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
      .header h1 { color: #c9a84c; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
      .header p { color: #a0aec0; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .body { padding: 40px; }
      .body p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #4a5568; }
      .cta { text-align: center; margin: 32px 0; }
      .cta a { background: #c9a84c; color: #1a1a2e; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; }
      .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
      .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0; margin: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>LETSMEET</h1>
        <p>Exclusive Membership Network</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>You have been personally invited by <strong><%= @sender.display_name %></strong> to join <strong>LetsMeet</strong> — an exclusive, invite-only network for exceptional people.</p>
        <p>Your invitation is valid until <strong><%= @expires_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></strong>. Use the link below to claim your membership.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <%= link_to "Accept Your Invitation", @sign_up_url %>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #718096;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this URL:<br /><span style="color: #c9a84c;"><%= @sign_up_url %></span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #718096;">This invitation is for <strong><%= @invitation.recipient_email %></strong> only and cannot be transferred.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>LetsMeet &bull; Exclusively Curated &bull; Confidential</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
